---
import {getAllGames} from '../../lib/games.js';
const games=getAllGames().filter(g=>g.status==='human_made');
const names={ingame:'In-game generation',code:'Code',art:'Art',music:'Music',voice:'Voice',writing:'Writing',translation:'Translation',marketing:'Marketing'};
const canonical='https://gameaichecker.com/collections/human-made-steam-games/';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>Steam games with human-made and no-AI claims | Game AI Checker</title><meta name="description" content="Compare source-backed human-made claims for Steam games. See who made the claim, which areas it covers, and whether the site owner reviewed the listing."/><link rel="canonical" href={canonical}/><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/logo.svg"/><style>:root{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:#182437;background:#fcfdff}body{margin:0}main,header{max-width:1080px;margin:auto;padding:24px}a{color:#176bc1}h1{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.035em}.answer{background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #dce9f6;border-radius:14px;padding:20px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px;margin:26px 0}article{border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:white}article img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:460/215;object-fit:cover}article div{padding:18px}h2{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 8px}.muted{font-size:13px;color:#667085}p{max-width:75ch}.tag{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;background:#f0fdf4;color:#166534;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:20px;padding:3px 10px}details{padding:18px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:12px}summary{font-weight:650;cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:760px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:440px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body><header><a href="/">Game AI Checker</a> · <a href="/browse/">Browse all records</a></header><main><p class="muted">SOURCE-BACKED CLAIMS · CHECK THE SCOPE</p><h1>Steam games with human-made claims</h1><div class="answer"><strong>{games.length} reviewed records include a human-made claim.</strong><p>These are attributed claims. A statement about artwork does not certify code, music or every other area. Site owner reviews are labeled separately and are not third-party certification.</p></div><div class="grid">{games.map(g=><article>{g.header && <a href={`/games/en/${g.slug}/`}><img src={g.header} alt={`${g.name} — official Steam cover`} loading="lazy"/></a>}<div><h2><a href={`/games/en/${g.slug}/`}>{g.name}</a></h2><span class="tag">{g.humanMadeListing?.kind==='site_owner_review' && g.humanMadeListing?.verified?'Site owner review passed':'Developer self-report'}</span><p class="muted">{g.developer}</p><p>Claimed areas: {g.areas.filter(a=>a.state==='claimed_none').map(a=>names[a.key]).join(', ') || 'see the original statement'}.</p><p class="muted">Review date: {g.reviewedAt || 'See record'}</p><a href={`/games/en/${g.slug}/`}>Read the claim &amp; sources →</a></div></article>)}</div><details><summary>What this list establishes</summary><p>Each entry is selected from an existing reviewed record classified as a human-made claim. Inclusion is not a technical audit of the game's files or development history. Read the dated original statement and area notes before treating a claim as covering a particular production area.</p></details><p><a href="/guides/how-to-check-steam-game-ai/">How to check if a Steam game uses AI →</a></p><p><a href="/events/steam-next-fest-october-2026-ai-disclosures/">Next Fest games with official AI disclosures →</a></p></main></body></html>
